# ─── Local Claude Code setup — deliberately NOT versioned ───────────────────
# This repo is public/source-available; the Claude configuration is personal
# tooling, not part of the product. Keep it local.
#
# NOTE: .claude/ was tracked before 2026-08-21 (commits 3a1534a, f34b5b7 and
# others), so those older files remain in the published git history even though
# new work here is ignored. Removing them from history needs a rewrite.
.claude/
__tests__/claude/
docs/README.md
